</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00160/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一正常尺寸黑色U盘，容量64G，必须在翻转三次或以上后才能插入USB接口，无论在视觉上接口与U盘是否匹配。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>陕西省██市一电子产品专卖店内，经检查其余商品无异常性质。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>由研究员李██持有<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>买到它时我差点弄坏了电脑接口。——研究员李██</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00160" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00160" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00160-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leaven" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5979701); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5979701&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605945759" alt="LEAVEN" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5979701)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leaven" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5979701); return false;">LEAVEN</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588772366 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">06 May 2020 13:39</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00275/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张A4纸，表面文字内容约500字，多半带有悔过及自责情感，推测为检讨书。</p>
<p>当人类个体听到或看到该文字内容时将变得内疚，并说出自己最近犯的过错。在离开收容间后将恢复正常。且在24小时内出现至少3次的“悔过”行为，其均为无记忆的。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██市███小学<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被收容于Site-CN-██一个5m高的升降封闭载物台中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>以后谁再违反基金会守则，他就等着欣赏检讨书吧。——Dr.Yostem</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00275" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00275" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00275-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yostem" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6056440); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6056440&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605945759" alt="Yostem" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6056440)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yostem" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6056440); return false;">Yostem</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1592574896 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">19 Jun 2020 13:54</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00068/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一盘石磨，材质为石膏，上面雕刻有一个投币口和一句话“收件人：阴间礼部张书吏”，投进去一角钱，就会自动转三分钟。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██省石料厂<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-CN-██的休息室中，允许员工投币自磨豆浆。投进去的硬币将作为捐赠款。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>“有钱能使鬼推磨。”这话一点也不假，哼，这玩意儿一定是鬼造的</em>——Dr.shadeoi<br />
<em>我们喝豆浆都喝吐了，所以我们不会再投币了，不会！</em>——特工EVIL</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00068" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00068" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00068-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6316800&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605945759" alt="Steven the shadow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6316800)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;">Steven the shadow</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587022723 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 Apr 2020 07:38</span></p>
</div>
